<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's JSE suspends Gentech listing.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's JSE suspends Gentech listing.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Monday that it had suspended General Technologies Ltd's (Gentech) shares.</p>
<p>The suspension was at the request of the company's directors and pending clarity on the final terms of Gentech's disposal of the entire issued share capital of Gentech Trading Ltd, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
